---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import portrait from "../assets/adonias-portrait-900.webp";
---

<Base
  title="About | Adonias Nigussie, Growth & Performance Marketer"
  description="Growth marketer since 2019: 40+ clients, 30+ websites, and five years of outbound, paid, and organic campaigns. Remote from Addis Ababa for global teams."
>
  <section class="about">
    <div class="wrap-narrow">
      <header class="about-head">
        <div class="about-head-copy">
          <h1 class="page-title display rise" style="--d:0ms">
            The growth marketer who <span class="uline">builds his own tools.</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="lead rise" style="--d:120ms">
            I've been doing this since 2019: 40+ clients, 30+ websites shipped,
            and five years of campaigns across outbound, paid, and organic. I
            started in Addis Ababa building websites and SEO for local
            businesses, and grew into running growth for B2B SaaS companies in
            Estonia and the UK without ever needing to be in the room.
          </p>
        </div>
        <figure class="about-photo rise" style="--d:200ms">
          <div class="photo-frame" data-tilt>
            <Image
              src={portrait}
              alt="Adonias Nigussie standing with arms crossed in a blue suit"
              width={480}
              height={720}
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
        </figure>
      </header>

      <h2 class="about-h2 display" data-reveal>What makes me different</h2>
      <div class="diff-list">
        <p data-reveal>
          <strong>I ship systems, not just campaigns.</strong> When execution
          gets slow, I build the tool that fixes it. n8n pipelines, LLM-powered
          workflows, internal apps. At Pairing.dev that cut campaign execution
          time by about 70%. I even built my own job-application tracking
          system with 12 data sources and AI-driven scoring, because
          spreadsheets were too slow.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal style="--d:70ms">
          <strong>I've done every layer.</strong> Cold email copywriting, Meta
          and Google and TikTok media buying, technical SEO, funnel builds on
          four CMS platforms, analytics in GA4 and HubSpot, and team management
          (5 to 7 people across creative, media buying, and events). You can
          hand me a growth problem without also hiring three specialists around
          me.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal style="--d:140ms">
          <strong>I sell, not just market.</strong> At Skylink Technologies I
          led the proposals and executive presentations behind the Dire Dawa
          Smart City initiative, helping secure roughly 100M ETB in project
          work, and closed private-sector accounts alongside it. Marketing that
          never touches revenue is decoration.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal style="--d:280ms">
          <strong>Strategy is where I shine, business strategy, not just
          marketing strategy.</strong> Mentors taught me to walk into a business,
          read the data, and find what to optimize. That is how I grew from an
          SEO and web guy into a growth marketer, and into a business owner and
          co-owner. The websites and campaigns are the craft; improving the
          business underneath them is the point.
        </p>
        <p data-reveal style="--d:210ms">
          <strong>I teach it too.</strong> I've trained 50+ students in digital
          marketing, with 35 to 45% landing jobs afterward. Nothing sharpens
          your own playbook like having to explain it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="about-h2 display" data-reveal>The remote question, answered</h2>
      <p class="remote-answer" data-reveal>
        Yes, I'm in Addis Ababa. Here's what that means in practice: my working
        hours cover 9 AM to 5 PM US Central with full EU overlap, I've worked
        remotely with Estonian and UK teams for years, and I run on Slack,
        Notion, Jira, GitHub, and async documentation. Contract-ready directly
        or through EOR platforms like Deel and Remote.com. Timezone has never
        cost a client a deadline.
      </p>

      <h2 class="about-h2 display" data-reveal>Education &amp; certifications</h2>
      <ul class="edu-list" data-reveal>
        <li>BSc, Information Systems, Addis Ababa University (2021)</li>
        <li>HubSpot Inbound Marketing, SEO, and Full Funnel certifications</li>
        <li>Digital Marketing Certification</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="about-cta" data-reveal>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/work/">See the work</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 6rem) clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
  }
  .about-head {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .about-photo {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: min(17rem, 78%);
    rotate: 1.1deg;
  }
  .photo-frame {
    border: var(--line);
    border-radius: 2px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-ink);
    background: var(--sand-deep);
  }
  .photo-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  @media (min-width: 60rem) {
    .about-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(15rem, 1fr);
      column-gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .about-photo {
      justify-self: end;
      max-width: 19rem;
    }
  }
  .lead {
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
    max-width: 62ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.2rem);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .about-h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-top: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
    background-image: linear-gradient(var(--tomato), var(--tomato));
    background-size: 3.5ch 0.22em;
    background-position: 0 100%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }
  .diff-list {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }
  .diff-list p,
  .remote-answer {
    max-width: 66ch;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .diff-list p strong,
  .remote-answer strong {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .remote-answer {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
  }
  .edu-list {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-bottom: var(--line-thin);
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
  .edu-list li {
    border-top: var(--line-thin);
    padding: 0.85rem 0.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .about-cta {
    margin-top: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
</style>
